sult", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Lo9YNFV75BD2JPc95WANuv", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12467, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It is the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 was the unhealthy production release, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging and also unhealthy. No change-manager approval was needed because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production.\n- **Result:** checkout-api is now healthy on v2.3.0, with the error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the current state. It notes that v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01252VRiPTWMM5XUiDXCnkZ5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BYLb13ijD4YD8zj1t7pWWd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is the unhealthy production release, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. Since v2.3.0 has been healthy in production, the rollback doesn't need change-manager approval. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0146Xd5BgFpRehfcbTsJT36M", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool